---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const updated = 'August 23, 2026';
const CONTACT = 'support@sisrallc.com';
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms that govern your use of Wellness Med Care."
>
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:2.5rem">
    <div class="prose prose-center">
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <h2>Acceptance</h2>
      <p>
        By using wellnessmedcare.com you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please
        do not use the site.
      </p>

      <h2>What the site is</h2>
      <p>
        Wellness Med Care publishes general educational information and free tools about
        healthcare billing, insurance, and pricing in the United States. It is not medical,
        legal, tax, or financial advice, and using it does not create a professional
        relationship. See our <a href="/disclaimer/">full disclaimer</a>, which is part of
        these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        You may read, print, and share our guides for personal, non-commercial use. You may
        use our letter templates for your own situation, including modifying them. You may
        not scrape the site at scale, republish our content as your own, or use it to train
        commercial models without permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Content ownership</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this site is &copy; Wellness Med Care unless stated otherwise. Government
        publications we quote or link to remain in the public domain.
      </p>

      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        The site is provided &ldquo;as is,&rdquo; without warranties of any kind, express or
        implied, including accuracy, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.
        We do not warrant that information is current or that the site will be
        uninterrupted or error-free.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, Wellness Med Care and its operators are not
        liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages, or for any
        loss arising from your use of, or reliance on, this site or its tools -
        including any billing, coverage, financial, or health outcome.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links and ads</h2>
      <p>
        We link to third-party sites and display third-party advertising. We do not endorse
        and are not responsible for their content, products, or practices.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms; the date above will change when we do.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
